-- restated in the negative. The eighth (s7_no_hardcoded_boot) is broader
-- than its §3.2 twin — it covers schema validation and the sees/leak/breach
-- audits as well — so it is not listed here.

restates[map](s7_no_clause_objects, s_evaluator_reads_store).
restates[map](s7_no_log_provenance, s_provenance_per_firing).
restates[map](s7_no_witness_excise, s_excise_not_from_witness).
restates[map](s7_no_nondeterministic_iteration, s_determinism).
restates[map](s7_no_silent_overrun, s_budget_emits_hole).
restates[map](s7_no_skipping_reject_path, s_reject_unstratified).
restates[map](s7_no_pretend_async, s_async_reserved_rejected).

-- ---- obligations discharged by an artefact, not a test --------------------
-- `document the omission` is not testable; it is done or it is not, and the
-- census checks that the document is still there.

discharged_by[map](s_document_no_occurs_check, "LIMITS.md").
discharged_by[map](s_done_readme, "README.md").
discharged_by[map](s_done_limits, "LIMITS.md").
